{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:763bee3a57da1887cbbe3a10e3dd2373c0972cfcfbb7fe3d94a533eab96494f9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bcc4f84c0d28efdca7989db163b82b4c19e6ce6c15f4ed324a057afdbb611d4",
      "text": "A special surprise for you！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68e909a2b97ba9b4ba0bac53b7aa8f8c37140a8c1394769264b9e568c9113330",
      "text": "在某档综艺脱口秀节目中，\n薰和翼收到了为即将过生日的辉\n准备惊喜企划的邀请。\n一无所知迎来生日当天的辉，\n收到的VTR内容是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000015:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000015:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bcc4f84c0d28efdca7989db163b82b4c19e6ce6c15f4ed324a057afdbb611d4",
      "text": "A special surprise for you！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afdc9f8ed8fc32d71a16e014b000758e6d7471c2ac16870110100f1c71e78eba",
      "text": "脱口秀节目开会当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cf27d1485cae25fe8a3edef28d3ffd8983d2bd3be4c6de86ab2abdd381d031f",
      "text": "为什么这次碰头会，\n没有叫辉先生呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7b33ed60a2be07bc601de457029a93c9217236cc56b8d0360a0ce9fb7b88e4b",
      "text": "刚才明明还在一起开会的……\n薰先生怎么看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb5f19217b2775f8991c7ffb6f980fe0f4efd2e3b410f62b98dbdf016b6bbd10",
      "text": "工作人员和制作人马上就到了。\n到时候就明白了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92ba61cab6c9176dd1defe8406d7c32d8d4b8edeac8a98546af62851e24fd4d8",
      "text": "让二位久等了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c4db2ebacc99c328ae11f935d3ed28532c238cb6b7a51dad0662bfdc484c810",
      "text": "那么，我们开始开会吧。\n其实，有个企划想请两位参加。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6c3b19b4bc269d55856b541eef17a22f47cfab322afc9044ee7996a8b29adb",
      "text": "录制当天正好是天道先生的生日。那时候，\n要不要给天道先生准备一个惊喜庆祝呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0807d556b1bcb0a260f53544440f48280f7a448b8bab9528188b607729278f4d",
      "text": "……啊。所以才只叫了我们两个啊。\n薰先生，要办吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17f8c605e91b19ed64e92e830b5058b18854563c47aaea06f4fe243d0b6c8a35",
      "text": "我刚好也想找你商量\n辉先生的生日礼物呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5ff43de1712f3f2e99bea1604c09779bcbdf7e7cac6965bfbd9e5993ce9f0b6",
      "text": "等等。在接下之前，我有些事情要确认。\n既然特意开会来谈，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1b6349617a0ba27f0344915c72500fab2bff673b66e3de7609d3d8815256547",
      "text": "应该不只是单纯的庆祝吧？\n如果有企划书，请让我过目一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2668340b234bca02e4e47e8d2bf1626c1526728394b1297b6eb2fd79a47a7fbf",
      "text": "脱口秀录制当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ff172e9978baf251e554893511a52084ce5fa18b45a1899061bb56dbde7408f",
      "text": "在那部电视剧里我们全员，\n都对自己的角色感同身受了对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89e4526eb93ba868cf96980db25ad0ee2b16a52693013ea89a95e8e4dfac954d",
      "text": "虽然性格截然不同，\n但总觉得有些地方很相像呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:705ad16afdbe23bcd21790f4d92e465c8a28e9f2d414b1bd695f8fe70eec88d5",
      "text": "我倒希望观众能带着“和我们有相似之处”的视角\n再去重温一遍呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2fa95b795a53def612f653e88cf1347bb3a38f5529e12cb091ed1a3e77a3d29",
      "text": "有什么令人印象深刻的\n与其他共演者的插曲吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c19eb275b9a05bd80bc83099ffa1c765e3924c6562b001109d5e2e6ad846847",
      "text": "辉先生和导演聊战队的话题，\n一直聊得非常起劲，这让我印象很深。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96104dcaaa35dbf87282f6390faedd66661123fc2f3c26b248c60dd07967f961",
      "text": "确实如此。他常常说去打个招呼，\n结果半天都不回来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc8b1343bfdb93b650ab236f8ec4da8f889b356311c90c345dd3a598eade78f1",
      "text": "我是在聊我们一起看过的战队特摄啦。\n当时把你们俩也叫上就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fcc7bf3668e67315db6504a08f763cd9ef998be46110adb8907f6565e791cc0",
      "text": "三个人一起看战队特摄，关系真好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8e3dda67407eea272f952313b4cbfd0a41296194524b106bbde45cf7e31d6e4",
      "text": "那么，接下来樱庭先生和柏木先生两位，\n给天道先生准备了一段VTR哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51d43b945a89885d30a1b48460b4052cd46a0442f0e529623bc1666c78079384",
      "text": "哎，VTR！？\n开会的时候没提过这事啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_c:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa779d2cfd48f59efe1e794c3a370430c4c317a1c1ac095bdd900ef92981bbd5",
      "text": "2月22日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb5455445cadc52d7ed6197701c11758c4a4f72ab4d21f4473a6ac13ee42aac0",
      "text": "大家好！有些突然，2月23日是什么日子，\n薰先生应该知道吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31cda9a12abd01c0cc6cc725faf4eb4d97caa9689ba5533ce43697172c7c2ba2",
      "text": "是天道的生日。\n而且当天也是这个节目的录制日。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b2005c52a14a300b04106f1f0d83978080907b8e89e90ffb7cd81647ba1e274",
      "text": "正在看这个的天道应该也猜到了吧。\n我们接下来要给天道做生日蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49223f9d04aec47c5959eebed174cb37c53224f74a7943b7cdda1fbca79006a7",
      "text": "我们会和甜点师一起做，\n辉先生请好好期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:346319c2ffd9185c62be656c9a90cd609653b96dd742d3c74251bad87db40020",
      "text": "蛋糕的大小要怎么定呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc61ef93a650f4fcaa1eebc3b0e90af444b01ba83dd72eac33b44c7033c2d1db",
      "text": "做大一点比较好。毕竟按照天道的性格，\n肯定会叫在场所有人一起吃的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2868dc4570d5dcdd48a89db6fb905e3b1b94bf3bd7288b254c4b20d0b12f4985",
      "text": "呵呵，确实是呢。\n那就做一个超级大的吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b676c94b7cdd5340ac452029e6cb243d4d3172399a8d9faa36224621e73926ef",
      "text": "接下来是种类。虽说有甜点师帮忙，\n但还是得做符合我们能力的东西才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07e73be25af4c66874605745c88231e96a78792b374a2fbf95ab3bc54034f7ae",
      "text": "果然还是被称作经典的，\n草莓鲜奶油蛋糕之类的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ce4b424b410ade61984069c7b280f2c354eeac10144d4d7cdb9f578c8d8184c",
      "text": "……那个，关于蛋糕用的材料，\n用辉先生家乡的特产怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57e6babe92c541683d217cf7229fc69ae5efb4f508bf7c640fa3ee527d3dd013",
      "text": "那么那么，坐新干线长途跋涉之后……\n我们现在在哪里呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67b84b17aa14c09bef2a0cd6090d45280f35c3364d81c17cf6b07c078639a90d",
      "text": "（什么在哪……这景色我看着好眼熟啊。\n这不是我老家吗！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ea21107acc2a56ca0b946a0c314a6d3590b40b8dab6def699044decba1c9931",
      "text": "（而且字幕上的日期是昨天。也就是说，\n你们昨天特意跑去我老家了！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf09c1adda8727193ddc84ec32fb82d1b5420dac586492195fde1e7bcf21cb55",
      "text": "（明明光是材料的话，\n在附近也能买到的吧……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8120011cb4488b4b082419884ed6b1cc9bb473196396aff4afd2865d95a47e9",
      "text": "哇，看起来好好吃的草莓。……哎！\n可以试吃吗？非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a8e5713d91d7744e5e28b03a53db1bb9a1656420bb44434eba541e72fcc1072",
      "text": "嗯……味道很好，卖相也不错。\n应该能做出符合预期的蛋糕了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25b299368d7f1c9ff644a46f33360fad82f3faf3fd869a69d8808e7758b90d2b",
      "text": "（你们两个，为了我居然跑了这么多地方\n找食材吗……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae348b8d1f687b54f4f4090b6880d4ae0973ff647b08f8acc462fa8c2e00d917",
      "text": "嘿嘿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ffcbd58668bcf8c152c6ee913d010855af2cd35b1d57713029293858d63e062",
      "text": "樱庭、翼，你们这招太犯规了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ebfb166cdc585e4324acb69232968b4ee368244b84a8f3ee123e4da0a970b34",
      "text": "辉先生～接下来蛋糕就要登场了，\n敬请期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:293f68243319cc7b7da5ea64365ae6ca02bbf1660c6af14fc5d5417a8bf1e1a3",
      "text": "（在工作人员和共演者们的掌声中，\n暗下灯光的演播室里推进来了一个巨大的蛋糕……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:422a21cde551d01007396c56b4d2bfaca118f14703dd78c7700c12d667050983",
      "text": "祝你生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:020c8aa94ade54d9a4d0bfa9f18aa5cae86a90c7c0971db3f56b3381d49fdb95",
      "text": "好厉害，这真的是你们做的吗！\n而且比我想象的还要大啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4817485df5a314222743f2e3e2d48473015976d468d2012262b35a8c57977cf",
      "text": "有了蛋糕，我今天可真是“糕”兴啊，开玩笑的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6566b4f22e03bf9c8712e09eec5b06f0caa6bfd9e5a4949e783d53936391eee",
      "text": "别讲冷笑话了，赶紧把蜡烛吹灭。\n蜡烛都要化了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21e87d863d4954519750f45bc9b618b9106134f347dea886c2c704f16bcc3bcc",
      "text": "都说了是搞笑段子啦！\n哇，说话间蜡烛真的开始融化了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb86bcd93c4865b4e03cf3c582c5436f0d92a09b5e89c5b6f635bf3638cf4b62",
      "text": "参与制作这个蛋糕的各位，\n还有樱庭、翼。谢谢你们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f7aef2e31aef6850091961acf0390e70115ca96e29c3a800bcf550326c4a41f",
      "text": "呼——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fde395037abdc0211ff8a0762c6725c1a9cf1d270fb7d1cf9fdcadef383853c5",
      "text": "呐，我可以尝一口吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b327c286e5ecc9ccd5b3cd64fb22ac54f6939e346492d6947c34b25a32b7ec4",
      "text": "当然可以！\n不用客气只尝一口，想吃多少都行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:028e610964479e96264078baaaf12b82c1ac7a5f29bbabb754d0a9a9d3556d6b",
      "text": "我开动了！……唔～太好吃了！\n樱庭、翼，多谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5956b20ab6c3350618258e1e5fd92e2a1e644ced463071b822f913e7a91dd5e",
      "text": "那是当然。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_02_1_2_004_02:1_2_004_02_e:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fec913c2a56966d439bb72cd3eb60968da53d7ae70c18be77975eb9c6bd70311",
      "text": "呵呵，太好了。请多吃一点哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
